## Screen Structure Requirements

### Base Screen Structure
Every screen MUST follow this exact structure:
```tsx
export default function ScreenName() {
  return (
    <>
      {/* For screens with custom header options */}
      <Stack.Screen
        options={{
          // header options here
        }}
      />
      <ScrollView contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior="automatic">
        <YStack gap="$4" p="$4">
          {/* Screen content */}
        </YStack>
      </ScrollView>
    </>
  )
}
```

Key requirements:
1. For regular screens, use fragment (`<>`) as root element if screen has header options
2. For modal screens with `presentation: "modal"`, MUST wrap the entire screen content in `<PortalProvider>` to ensure all Tamagui components work properly
3. Use Tamagui's `ScrollView` with `contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior="automatic"`
4. First child inside ScrollView MUST be `YStack` with exactly `gap="$4" p="$4"`
5. No custom styling or theming on components unless explicitly required
6. For modals, MUST include close button in header:
```tsx
headerLeft: () => (
  <Button onPress={() => router.dismiss()}>
    <Button.Text>Close</Button.Text>
  </Button>
),
```

### Examples

1. Modal Screen:
```tsx
import { Stack, useRouter } from "expo-router"
import { ScrollView, YStack, Button, PortalProvider } from "tamagui"
import { Platform } from "react-native"
import React from "react"

export default function ModalScreen() {
  const router = useRouter()

  const handleBack = () => {
    if (router.canGoBack()) {
      router.back()
    } else if (Platform.OS === "web") {
      router.dismissTo("/")
    } else {
      router.dismiss()
    }
  }

  return (
    <PortalProvider>
      <Stack.Screen
        options={{
          title: "Modal Title",
          headerTitleAlign: "center",
          headerLeft: () => (
            <Button onPress={handleBack}>
              <Button.Text>Close</Button.Text>
            </Button>
          ),
        }}
      />
      <ScrollView contentInsetAdjustmentBehavior="automatic">
        <YStack gap="$4" p="$4">
          {/* Modal content */}
        </YStack>
      </ScrollView>
    </PortalProvider>
  )
}
```

2. Half-Sheet Modal Screen:
